License scope
=============

The nested repro/ package retains its existing MIT license in repro/LICENSE.
That notice applies to the work covered by that original license.

No additional blanket license is asserted here for the remaining source,
manuscript, exported figures, third-party mappings, datasets or model weights.
Their applicable rights and terms remain with the respective holders. Model
weights and restricted clinical data are not included. The source project did
not provide a root-wide license; this release preserves that status instead of
assigning a new license on behalf of the authors.

See NOTICE.md for included third-party material and provenance.
